      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know i should see a doctor eventually but i'm just so busy right now and it's not like it's constant. it only happens when i'm moving around. if i take a double dose of Tums or maybe some of those liquid antacids, wouldn't that just settle it down for the day? i really dont want to sit in a waiting room for hours if it's just reflux.",
