      "content": "yeah i get that but it's really just a burning sensation, so it makes sense that it's stomach related. if i just take a higher dose of the liquid stuff tonight so i can sleep better, is there any reason i shouldn't? it doesn't feel like an emergency, it's just annoying when i try to walk around.",
